DeerFlow display component adaptation
=====================================

Upstream: https://github.com/bytedance/deer-flow
Pinned commit: d3a9c123ff7ce37d6f6af3c7b065ef501fe16cb0
License: MIT (full text below)

Adapted source files (presentation only; state, protocol and business logic
remain the platform's own):

- deerflow-conversation.tsx  <- frontend/src/components/ai-elements/conversation.tsx
- deerflow-messages.tsx      <- frontend/src/components/ai-elements/message.tsx
- deerflow-tool-call.tsx     <- frontend/src/components/workspace/messages/tool-call-details.tsx

Adaptations: upstream AI SDK UIMessage / LangGraph ToolCall types replaced with
the platform Pi display types (ChatMessage in ../pi-chat-messages.tsx); Radix /
Lucide controls replaced with platform primitives and @tabler/icons-react;
streamdown replaced with the platform's audited safe Markdown renderer
(AssistantResponse); use-stick-to-bottom not added (platform follow-scroll in
../pi-chat.tsx remains authoritative). No new runtime dependency.

